%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Labyrinth3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099618523054181
    - rid: 268099618523054182
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, I remember that mural...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099618523054183
    - rid: 268099618523054184
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: This is about where Takes-in-Light... gave up.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099618523054185
    - rid: 268099618523054186
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not entirely sure how she died, we never heard from her after we
      moved past toward Morokei.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492802
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The ghosts appear once more, with only three of them remaining.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492803
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>We shouldn't have left her there to die!</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>What else could we do? Stay there and die with her? She refused
      to go on, we didn't have a choice!</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>This is it, you know. Through this door. Can you feel it?</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>... we're not going to make it, are we?</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>We stay together, no matter what. Agreed?</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>I'll be right with you.</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Agreed. We all stay together.</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The ghosts fade away.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492804
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d64100fc3c084684aa842f277fcb2790, type: 2}
    dialog: Come, face your end!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796432
    - rid: 268099640005492806
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: We'll see whose end we'll be facing...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492807
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, it's another word wall.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492808
    - rid: 268099640005492809
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you still have your journal on you, Yuri?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, yes.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492810
    - rid: 268099640005492811
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri takes out her journal, noting down the contents of the word wall
      for {mc}.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Noting down the dovahzul, eh?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep, our friend asked us to!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492812
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, you're friends with the dragonborn?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492813
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: The guy who yelled out at the whole of Skyrim?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492814
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep! He's my <SineText=4>best~</SineText> friend.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492815
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: I see.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: You should probably tell him to not blast private matters all across
      the country.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492816
    - rid: 268099640005492817
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492818
    - rid: 268099640005492819
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Just past this door is Morokei's lair.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492820
    - rid: 268099640005492821
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Right now, the spirits of Atmah and Hafnar are challening their power
      into him-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: The two of you will need to dispel them before we can even hurt Morokei.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Dispel how? Is there some sort of ritual we need to perform?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492825
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: No. You'll just have to... destroy them. In any way you see fit.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492826
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: While the two of you do that, I'll attract Morokei's attention.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492827
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's go.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492828
    - rid: 268099640005492829
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492832
    - rid: 268099640005492833
    - rid: 268099640005492834
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Alright, Yuri. Time to put this poor soul to rest; a good use for my
      blade.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492835
    - rid: 268099640005492836
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri summons her dagger and slashes at what was once Hafnar, finally
      releasing his soul to Aetherius.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492837
    - rid: 4972360475574796433
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492839
    - rid: 268099640005492840
    - rid: 268099640005492841
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'm sorry it took so long, Ms. Atmah...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (But we're here to put a stop to this for good!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492844
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori bonks what was once Atmah over the head with her mace, releasing
      her soul to Aetherius too.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796434
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d64100fc3c084684aa842f277fcb2790, type: 2}
    dialog: So Savos, you think you could fight me with two little girls?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492846
    - rid: 268099640005492847
    - rid: 268099640005492848
    - rid: 268099640005492849
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d64100fc3c084684aa842f277fcb2790, type: 2}
    dialog: You've somehow grown more foolish in our time apart.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Savos doesn't give Morokei the dignity of a pithy comeback and instead
      raises his hands to do battle.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori and Yuri come to Savos' aid as the fight begins.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492852
    - rid: 268099640005492853
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099640005492850
    - rid: 268099640005492851
    - rid: 268099640005492854
    - rid: 268099640005492855
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d64100fc3c084684aa842f277fcb2790, type: 2}
    dialog: Impressive, despite your new companions being far weaker, your power
      has become notable, Savos.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099663653503092
    - rid: 268099663653503093
    - rid: 268099663653503094
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d64100fc3c084684aa842f277fcb2790, type: 2}
    dialog: You must feel hopeful right now; you will finally be able to avenge your
      fallen friends.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d64100fc3c084684aa842f277fcb2790, type: 2}
    dialog: A shame then, even without this staff, the power granted to me by the
      dragons far eclipses anything the mortals of today can muster!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Morokei releases an attack whose form Sayori and Yuri can't really comprehend,
      which blasts Savos directly in the chest.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796435
    - rid: 268099663653503096
    - rid: 268099663653503098
    - rid: 268099663653503099
    - rid: 268099663653503104
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Grnk!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099663653503097
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: You two... I'm sorry...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099663653503100
    - rid: 268099663653503101
    - rid: 268099663653503102
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d64100fc3c084684aa842f277fcb2790, type: 2}
    dialog: Now, all that's left to do is drain your power, finish these two children
      and then be on my way.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Funny thing... about that...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: I've learned a... useful... <i>trick</i>...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Morokei, dropping his hubris for a second to assure his victory, tries
      to drain Savos of his power before he can do anything unpredictable.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Morokei channels what could be best described as a green beam of lightning
      toward Savos, which is probably how he'll drain Savos' power.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Once the link is connected... you must... trap both souls...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Savos casts a strange purple spell at Morokei and then...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Stabs himself with a knife, killing himself.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099663653503105
    - rid: 268099663653503106
    - rid: 268099663653503107
    - rid: 4972360475574796436
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: 'From both the corpse of Savos and Morokei, tendrils of soul energy coalesce
      into a small black gem that was on Savos'' person. '
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099663653503109
    - rid: 268099663653503110
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d64100fc3c084684aa842f277fcb2790, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=3,1>WHAT</NoiseText>?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d64100fc3c084684aa842f277fcb2790, type: 2}
    dialog: That <NoiseText=3,1>bastard</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>I'm sorry you two. Soul-trapping the recipient of Morokei's
      power drain while it is on going is the only way I've found to counteract it.</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099663653503111
    - rid: 268099663653503114
    - rid: 268099663653503115
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Not only that, but it has permanently sealed the vast majority
      of his dragon-granted power away, since most of that is tied directly to his
      soul.</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099663653503121
    - rid: 268099663653503122
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Besides, I've learned that these sacrifices are best not
      forced on others.</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099663653503123
    - rid: 268099663653503124
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>I'm sorry I won't be able to finish the fight with you, but
      hopefully you should have the edge now.</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Good luck you two, make sure Mirabelle knows she's in charge
      now...</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099663653503119
    - rid: 268099663653503120
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The final ghost of the long-doomed expedition to Labyrinthian finally
      fades away...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099663653503116
    - rid: 268099663653503118
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d64100fc3c084684aa842f277fcb2790, type: 2}
    dialog: A clever display... no matter, once I'm finished with you two, I shall
      retrieve my power from that soul gem.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099663653503125
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099663653503126
    - rid: 268099663653503127
    - rid: 268099663653503128
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Haahh... haahh... A pile of ash... he's gotta be <i>dead</i> dead now,
      right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099663653503129
    - rid: 268099663653503130
    - rid: 268099663653503131
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Haahh... I believe so, yes...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That's good...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639040
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Hey, Yuri?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639041
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639042
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Why'd Morokei turn into a pile of ash? The other draugr don't do that.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639044
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Magic, I guess.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639045
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: It might be a similar phenomenon to the spectral draugr; a different
      method of necromantic preservation.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639046
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: While Yuri is knee-deep in her theorization, Sayori picks up the Staff
      of Magnus.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639047
    - rid: 268099682247639048
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, we got the staff. We should probably get back to the college.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639049
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Mr. Aren did say that we gotta tell Ms. Ervine that she's in charge now.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639050
    - rid: 268099682247639051
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As Sayori starts walking away, Yuri notices the mask Morokei left behind.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639052
    - rid: 268099682247639053
    - rid: 268099682247639054
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Hm. The rest of his clothes turned to ash with him, but his mask remains?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639055
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Maybe there's something special about it...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639056
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (If there is, maybe we should bring it back to the college too.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639057
    - rid: 268099682247639058
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Although, it could be cursed...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639059
    - rid: 268099682247639060
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (But if it <i>is</i> cursed, it would be irresponsible to leave it lying
      around...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639061
    - rid: 268099682247639062
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri? What are you doing?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639063
    - rid: 268099682247639064
    - rid: 268099682247639065
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, there's a mask lying there in the ash.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639066
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori picks up the mask.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639067
    - rid: 268099682247639068
    - rid: 268099682247639073
    - rid: 268099682247639126
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: It's a little creepy...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639069
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: But holding it does make me feel a little fuzzy~!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639070
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639071
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639072
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Why'd you pick that up! It could've been dangerous!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639127
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh? How so?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Because! That's an artifact that came from an ancient evil! Did you forget
      who it came from!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639128
    - rid: 268099682247639134
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639135
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I feel fine, so it should be okay, right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639129
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaahh... you really need to be more careful, Sayori...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639130
    - rid: 268099682247639131
    - rid: 268099682247639132
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sorry for scaring you, Yuri. I wasn't thinking...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639133
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's just go...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639136
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639137
    - rid: 268099682247639138
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you think {mc} would know anything about this mask?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639139
    - rid: 268099682247639140
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: He's specifically been through here, so probably-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639141
    - rid: 268099682247639142
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f41944cc1154c994cb6f046f1e761c3f, type: 2}
    dialog: Stop right there!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639143
    - rid: 268099682247639144
    - rid: 268099682247639145
    - rid: 268099682247639146
    - rid: 268099682247639147
    - rid: 268099682247639148
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (This guy looks like Ancano, you think he's one of those Filmore guys
      too?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639149
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Thalmor, Sayori.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639150
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f41944cc1154c994cb6f046f1e761c3f, type: 2}
    dialog: I was surprised when Ancano told me that Arch-Mage Aren took two students
      down here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639151
    - rid: 268099682247639152
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f41944cc1154c994cb6f046f1e761c3f, type: 2}
    dialog: From what we've seen, he was fairly passive, so surely whatever's down
      here would be worth... repossessing.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f41944cc1154c994cb6f046f1e761c3f, type: 2}
    dialog: Come now children, hand it over. Nice and easy.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f41944cc1154c994cb6f046f1e761c3f, type: 2}
    dialog: Because the three of us know who'd come out on top if it really came
      down to it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639153
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: No!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639154
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f41944cc1154c994cb6f046f1e761c3f, type: 2}
    dialog: You wish to die, then? So be it, face the wrath of the Thalmor-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639155
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori blasts the vile elf with the Staff of Magnus, causing him to disintegrate.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639156
    - rid: 4972360475574796437
    - rid: 268099682247639158
    - rid: 268099682247639159
    - rid: 268099682247639160
    - rid: 4972360390599770177
    - rid: 7856103139480961089
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... huh.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639162
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That was easy~!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639163
    - rid: 268099682247639164
    - rid: 268099682247639165
    - rid: 268099682247639183
    - rid: 268099682247639184
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not exactly sure what he was expecting...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639166
    - rid: 268099682247639167
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, how'd he get in here ahead of us?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639168
    - rid: 268099682247639169
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Bleak Falls Barrows had a back entrance up in the mountain, and Saarthal
      had a door that looped back to its entrance...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639170
    - rid: 268099682247639171
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe this place has a secret entrance too and he went through that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639173
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639172
    - rid: 268099682247639174
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Then why didn't <i>we</i> go through it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639175
    - rid: 268099682247639176
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639177
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Fresh air!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639178
    - rid: 268099682247639179
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: It's easy to forget how musty those dungeons are when you're down there
      for so long...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639180
    - rid: 268099682247639181
